specification (crates/crabgresql-bench/suites/tpch/create.sql and queries.sql).
TPC and TPC-H are trademarks of the Transaction Processing Performance Council.
The SQL was transcribed from the publicly available specification at the
standard substitution parameters; no part of TPC's `dbgen`, `qgen`, or any other
